---
import TerminalRecording from './TerminalRecording.astro';
---

<section
  id="iterations-panel"
  class="explorer-panel"
  role="tabpanel"
  aria-labelledby="iterations-tab"
  tabindex="0"
  data-explorer-panel
  hidden
>
  <header class="panel-header">
    <span><span class="panel-number">05</span> &middot; reliability across three iterations</span>
  </header>
  <TerminalRecording
    src="/casts/05-iterations.cast"
    label="Commit dyno running three iterations each in Claude Code, Codex, and Antigravity"
  />
  <div class="panel-content">
    <p class="panel-note">
      A single pass can be luck. Repeat each scenario and harness pair to
      measure consistency; Dynobox reports the pass rate and keeps evidence
      from every failure.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
